{{Quote|A mythical blade, forged from the darkest of metals and wielded by the strongest swordsman in the world.|Item}}
The '''Dark Blade''' is a {{Mythical}} [[sword]].

The Dark Blade stands as being a decent choice for PvP with great damage and a lot of combo potential if used with prediction. It requires, to some extent, skill to use the full potential of the sword.

==Obtainment==
The Dark Blade can be obtained in three different ways:
# Purchasing it for {{Robux|1,200}} from the [[Shop]].
# Being gifted the [[Dark Blade (Gamepass)]] by another player.
# Obtaining the [[Dark Blade (Gamepass)]] from a trade done with another player.

===Version 2===
The Dark Blade can be upgraded to its second version by completing [[The Son Quest]].

===Slayer Skin===
The Dark Blade has a third version known as the [[Slayer Skin]] where whenever the user activates [[Aura]], everything that was once green and black, turns to white and black. Unlocking this skin also rewards the {{Title|Slayer of God|outline=1|no=1}}.

